      "message_parsed": "В конфиге<br />\n<br />\n<code style=\"font-family: Monaco, 'Andale Mono', 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\nfont-size: 0.9em;\nfont-style: normal;\nline-height: 1.3em;\nbackground: #BFE6FF;\nborder: 1px solid #C6C6EA;\nborder-radius: 3.5px;\npadding: 1px 3px;\ncolor: #0F4D79;\ndisplay: inline-block;\nmargin-bottom: 2px;\"><br />\n$tr_cfg = array(<br />\n    &#039;autoclean&#039;             =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;off&#039;                   =&gt; false,<br />\n    &#039;off_reason&#039;            =&gt; &#039;temporarily disabled&#039;,<br />\n    &#039;numwant&#039;               =&gt; 50,<br />\n    &#039;update_dlstat&#039;         =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;expire_factor&#039;         =&gt; 2.5,<br />\n    &#039;compact_mode&#039;          =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;upd_user_up_down_stat&#039; =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;browser_redirect_url&#039;  =&gt; &#039;tracker.php&#039;,<br />\n    &#039;scrape&#039;                =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;limit_active_tor&#039;      =&gt; false,<br />\n    &#039;limit_seed_count&#039;      =&gt; 0,<br />\n    &#039;limit_leech_count&#039;     =&gt; 8,<br />\n    &#039;leech_expire_factor&#039;   =&gt; 60,<br />\n   <b><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"> &#039;limit_concurrent_ips&#039;  =&gt; false,</span></b><br />\n    &#039;limit_seed_ips&#039;        =&gt; 1, - тут со скольки апаов сидировать<br />\n    &#039;limit_leech_ips&#039;       =&gt; 1, - тут со скольки апаов качать<br />\n    &#039;tor_topic_up&#039;          =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;gold_silver_enabled&#039;   =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;retracker&#039;             =&gt; true,<br />\n    &#039;retracker_host&#039;        =&gt; &#039;<a href=\"http://retracker.local/announce\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">http://retracker.local/announce</a>&#039;,<br />\n);<br />\n</code><br />\nтолько подождать пока анонс пройдет и кеш обновится<br />\n<br />\nпояснения к этому списке в админке смотри",
